      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Previous posts exist regarding this issue:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/audio-volume-settings-doesnt-work-when-player-joins-the-world\n\nI've noticed the issue too, but it doesn't always happen. \n\nDespite its general impact on the gaming experience, not many people are talking about it. I think this is largely because it's so hard to consistently replicate the issue.\n\nTo get to the root of the problem, it's important to identify the specific conditions under which it occurs. This includes understanding which worlds are affected, what settings are enabled in those worlds, and under which user settings the issue doesn't arise.",
